{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39527","headline":"投翰林萧侍郎 · 张蠙","name":"投翰林萧侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九仞墙边绝路岐，野才非合自求知。\n灵湫岂要鱼栖浪，仙桂那容鸟寄枝。\n纤草不销春气力，微尘还助岳形仪。\n从来爲学投文镜，文镜如今更有谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}